flowchart TD
  PDF[Scientific PDF] --> Inspect[Deterministic inspection]
  Inspect --> Native{Reliable native content?}
  Native -->|yes| Extract[Native extraction]
  Native -->|no| Render[Adaptive render]
  Render --> Layout[Layout + region classification]
  Layout --> Route[Cost-aware router]
  Route --> OCR[Local OCR]
  Route --> Formula[Local formula model]
  Extract --> Validate[Validate fidelity]
  OCR --> Validate
  Formula --> Validate
  Validate --> SDR[Canonical SDR JSON]
  SDR --> Viewer[Original PDF + semantic overlay]
  SDR --> Export[JSON / HTML / MD / TeX / searchable PDF]
